                    {
                        "sense_id": "48f1fdde-dd7a-3a5b-ac2c-f3ccfc691bf8",
                        "entry_id": "4a2c2582-a843-3c09-9385-d1f99b2af5e6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "motto"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "07fc6b8d-6044-4ad6-bc70-b2e875dde5e4",
                                "sense_id": "48f1fdde-dd7a-3a5b-ac2c-f3ccfc691bf8",
                                "text": "Вы́шли мы все из наро́да,\nДе́ти семьи́ трудово́й.\n«Бра́тский сою́з и свобо́да» —\nВот наш деви́з боево́й!",
                                "translation": "We all stem from the people,\nChildren of the working household.\n“Brotherly union and freedom,”\nThis is our fight motto!",
                                "english": "We all stem from the people,\nChildren of the working household.\n“Brotherly union and freedom,”\nThis is our fight motto!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
